  "content": "[Intro]\n[C5]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bb5]Giving our blood\nto the doomsday ma-\n[C5]chine.\n[Bb5]Fighting for ravege land\na worthless\n[C5]gain.\n[Bb5]Marching\n[Ab5]on a [Gb5]dead end\n\n[Intrelude]\n[C5]road.\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bb5]A violet new disorder\nfeeding off mis-\n[C5]trust.\n[Bb5]Forgot what we're fighting for\na worthless\n[C5]aim.\nA\n[Bb5]victory\n[Ab5]stinking [Gb5]of des-\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb5]pair.\nDead eyes\nsee no future.\n[Gb5]\nFalling from\n[Ab5]grace.\n[F/A]We are coming\n[Bb5]home.\nDead eyes\nsee no future.\n[Gb5]\nFalling from\n[Ab5]grace.\n[F/A]We are coming\n\n[Intrelude]\n[C5]home.\nBat-\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Bb5]talions of hate\nseeking shelter\n[C5]in hell.\n[Bb5]Bloodstained memories\nwill we ever be for-\n[C5]given.\n[Bb5]Our twisted\n[Ab5]fate. [Gb5]Time will\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb5]tell.\nDead eyes\nsee no future.\n[Gb5]\nFalling from\n[Ab5]grace.\n[F/A]We are coming\n[Bb5]home.\nDead eyes\nsee no future.\n[Gb5]\nFalling from\n[Ab5]grace.\n[F/A]We are coming\n\n[Bridge]\n[Eb]home.\n[F]\n[Gm]\n[F/A]\n[Eb]\n[F]\n[Gm]\n[F/A]\n[Eb]\n[F]\n[Gm]\n[F/A]\n[Eb]\n[F]\n[Gm]\n[Bb5]\n[Gb]\n[Ab]\n[F]\n[Bbm]\n[Gb]\n[Ab]\n[Fm]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb5]\nDead eyes\nsee no future.\n[Gb5]\nFalling from\n[Ab5]grace.\n[F/A]We are coming\n\n[Solo]\n[C5]home.\n[Ab5]\n[Bb5]\n[G/B]\n[C5]\n[Ab5]\n[Bb5]\n[G/B]\n\n[Outro]\n[C5]",
